          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Rocks play a vital role in our lives. It takes thousands to millions of years to form rocks. Therefore, it is important to conserve and use them responsibly. Do you know how rocks and minerals are transported from one location to another? Most vehicles that we use for transportation use fossil fuels. Let us explore more about fossil fuels."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.499,
            0.332,
            0.524
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11.6 Fossil Fuels"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.291,
            0.786,
            0.447,
            0.881
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Surya, why do different types of vehicles go to different filling stations?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.522,
            0.763,
            0.678,
            0.874
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The reason is that they use different types of fuels. For example, petrol and diesel."
            }
          ]
        },
